{"5366230":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Make Me Whole","steam_appid":5366230,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single letter with no sender.<br>Inside were a photograph of an old doll and an address.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras\/3fdf6bd0e92ac1c4998be3369d99a1e9.avif?t=1793695464\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras_big\/3fdf6bd0e92ac1c4998be3369d99a1e9.avif?t=1793695464 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The address leads to a doll workshop that closed long ago.<br>The moment you step through the door, the same room begins to repeat, again and again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sign on the wall lists a few rules.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look carefully around the room.<br>If you find something strange, check the sewing machine.<br>If nothing is wrong, leave through the exit.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras\/da736497d788faf241871675bec13d81.avif?t=1793695464\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras_big\/da736497d788faf241871675bec13d81.webp?t=1793695464 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose correctly, a piece of the doll's body that went missing somewhere in the workshop comes back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the old notes left behind in each repeating room slowly reveal what happened to the one who sent the letter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the scattered doll whole again, and uncover the secret of the doll workshop....<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The same room. One thing wrong.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room in the workshop looks the same. But sometimes, something is just slightly off.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A sound that was not there a moment ago<\/li><li>Signs that someone has been here<\/li><li>Something that has drifted out of place<\/li><li>A gaze you can feel from somewhere<\/li><li>And things you will never notice unless you look very, very closely<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you tell what changed in this workshop?<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>32 anomalies<\/strong>: from changes you spot at a glance to ones you can walk past again and again without noticing.<\/li><li><strong>Eight correct calls in a row<\/strong>: a single mistake sends you back to the start.<\/li><li><strong>A story told in pieces<\/strong>: notes left behind in each room, and the truth that waits when every piece comes together.<\/li><li><strong>A doll stitched back together<\/strong>: every correct call returns another part of its body.<\/li><li><strong>13 achievements<\/strong>: including one only the most observant will ever earn.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Look<\/strong>: Walk through the workshop and study everything: the furniture, the dolls, the walls, the lights, even the sounds. The first room you enter is always unchanged, so remember it well.<\/li><li><strong>Decide<\/strong>: If you spot something strange, use the sewing machine. If nothing is wrong, leave through the exit.<\/li><li><strong>Keep going<\/strong>: A correct call takes you to the next room and returns a piece of the doll. A wrong call sends you back to the first room.<\/li><li><strong>Complete it<\/strong>: Make eight correct calls in a row to finish the doll and reach the end of the workshop's story.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls<\/strong>: Move with WASD or the arrow keys, look with the mouse, interact with E, pause with Esc. Gamepads are supported.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single letter with no sender.<br>Inside were a photograph of an old doll and an address.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras\/3fdf6bd0e92ac1c4998be3369d99a1e9.avif?t=1793695464\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras_big\/3fdf6bd0e92ac1c4998be3369d99a1e9.avif?t=1793695464 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The address leads to a doll workshop that closed long ago.<br>The moment you step through the door, the same room begins to repeat, again and again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sign on the wall lists a few rules.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look carefully around the room.<br>If you find something strange, check the sewing machine.<br>If nothing is wrong, leave through the exit.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras\/da736497d788faf241871675bec13d81.avif?t=1793695464\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/extras_big\/da736497d788faf241871675bec13d81.webp?t=1793695464 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose correctly, a piece of the doll's body that went missing somewhere in the workshop comes back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the old notes left behind in each repeating room slowly reveal what happened to the one who sent the letter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the scattered doll whole again, and uncover the secret of the doll workshop....<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The same room. One thing wrong.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room in the workshop looks the same. But sometimes, something is just slightly off.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A sound that was not there a moment ago<\/li><li>Signs that someone has been here<\/li><li>Something that has drifted out of place<\/li><li>A gaze you can feel from somewhere<\/li><li>And things you will never notice unless you look very, very closely<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you tell what changed in this workshop?<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>32 anomalies<\/strong>: from changes you spot at a glance to ones you can walk past again and again without noticing.<\/li><li><strong>Eight correct calls in a row<\/strong>: a single mistake sends you back to the start.<\/li><li><strong>A story told in pieces<\/strong>: notes left behind in each room, and the truth that waits when every piece comes together.<\/li><li><strong>A doll stitched back together<\/strong>: every correct call returns another part of its body.<\/li><li><strong>13 achievements<\/strong>: including one only the most observant will ever earn.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Look<\/strong>: Walk through the workshop and study everything: the furniture, the dolls, the walls, the lights, even the sounds. The first room you enter is always unchanged, so remember it well.<\/li><li><strong>Decide<\/strong>: If you spot something strange, use the sewing machine. If nothing is wrong, leave through the exit.<\/li><li><strong>Keep going<\/strong>: A correct call takes you to the next room and returns a piece of the doll. A wrong call sends you back to the first room.<\/li><li><strong>Complete it<\/strong>: Make eight correct calls in a row to finish the doll and reach the end of the workshop's story.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls<\/strong>: Move with WASD or the arrow keys, look with the mouse, interact with E, pause with Esc. Gamepads are supported.<\/p>","short_description":"A letter with no sender, a photo of the doll you lost as a child, and an address: a shuttered doll workshop where the same room keeps repeating. Something off? Sewing machine. Nothing? Take the exit. First-person anomaly-spotting horror about finishing a doll, and what moves when you look away.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/65805cb7b975f7bd128e72847dce59a51d19b3fd\/header.jpg?t=1793695464","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/340aba7a84af747717228b8d61d059062bf99dbd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793695464","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5366230\/340aba7a84af747717228b8d61d059062bf99dbd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793695464","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB \/ AMD Radeon RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 \/ AMD 